    title: "the shipped java plaintext source is slotted module=javax.crypto/name=Cipher.doFinal but the analyzer emits module=javax.crypto.Cipher/name=doFinal, so it never matches and no java plaintext flow exists"  # 84ee
    status: todo_hard  # 84ee
